WEBVTT

00:04.420 --> 00:06.980
Okay, I'm ready.

00:07.420 --> 00:10.930
All right, let's start.

00:11.120 --> 00:13.490
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:16.820 --> 00:18.020
It can't be.

00:20.400 --> 00:22.870
Ken-chan always plays "paper".

00:23.620 --> 00:25.090
That's because he's a "single-celled" organism.

00:26.320 --> 00:27.930
What did you say?

00:36.230 --> 00:37.010
Huh?

00:39.420 --> 00:40.420
What?

00:43.940 --> 00:46.150
Wait, I'm the first one!

00:46.270 --> 00:47.290
Why?

00:47.920 --> 00:51.060
That's mean, I'm the first one!

00:52.320 --> 00:54.920
It's all Onii-chan's fault. You're so mean!

00:56.820 --> 01:00.760
Don't quarrel with each other. Go in order.

01:01.020 --> 01:02.080
Sure!

01:05.920 --> 01:06.610
Go.

01:07.120 --> 01:07.770
Here I am.

01:12.020 --> 01:12.790
Let's play one more time.

01:15.300 --> 01:18.050
Hey, hurry up, it should be my turn.

01:18.420 --> 01:20.380
Follow the order, the order.

01:23.120 --> 01:24.980
I'm getting some water.

01:25.720 --> 01:27.220
Me too.

01:27.920 --> 01:29.080
How about you, Ken-chan?

01:29.320 --> 01:31.990
I'm not thirsty, Nanami, so go ahead.

01:32.790 --> 01:33.610
Okay.

01:42.420 --> 01:43.460
You're well-behaved.

01:46.920 --> 01:49.760
You always take care of your little sisters, right?

01:51.120 --> 01:53.820
I'm not doing it because I like it.

01:56.820 --> 01:57.950
Good, good boy.

01:58.020 --> 01:59.380
What're you doing?

02:05.820 --> 02:08.920
Tae-oneechan, we're hungry.

02:08.920 --> 02:10.670
Let's hurry up and go home now.

02:12.220 --> 02:13.160
See you.

02:23.420 --> 02:28.020
Student Council President and the Reward

03:13.720 --> 03:14.640
All right.

03:21.820 --> 03:22.980
It's morning already!

03:25.320 --> 03:27.180
Come on, get up.

03:31.420 --> 03:34.430
Tae-neechan, Onii-chan took my vegetable!

03:34.620 --> 03:36.480
Behave yourself and eat, okay?

03:37.120 --> 03:40.070
Nee-chan, I lost a sock.

03:40.220 --> 03:41.650
It's at the very bottom of the dresser.

03:42.120 --> 03:44.280
Onee-chan, where is my recorder?

03:44.420 --> 03:46.290
It fell off the corner of the desk.

03:46.420 --> 03:48.270
Onee-chan, I can't get the toothpaste out.

03:48.300 --> 03:50.490
There is a new one under the sink.

03:51.620 --> 03:52.990
Do you have your handkerchiefs and tissues?

03:54.520 --> 03:55.570
Did you forget anything?

03:55.820 --> 03:57.150
Not at all!

03:58.820 --> 03:59.950
Good, good.

04:01.320 --> 04:03.350
Nee-chan, you're like our father, too.

04:04.120 --> 04:05.320
Shouldn't it be mother?

04:05.320 --> 04:07.340
Onee-chan is Onee-chan.

04:07.420 --> 04:09.800
I didn't mean that.

04:10.020 --> 04:14.110
Okay, okay, hurry up and get going.

04:14.120 --> 04:15.620
We're leaving!

04:15.820 --> 04:17.250
Take care.

04:21.620 --> 04:23.510
Onee-chan... huh?

04:35.620 --> 04:38.370
It seems today will be hot, too.

04:38.420 --> 04:40.910
But we can feel the sea breeze here.

04:41.320 --> 04:43.180
It's better than in big cities.

04:43.620 --> 04:46.220
Hikari-chan said the same thing yesterday.

04:46.220 --> 04:48.200
Where is Hikari?

04:50.620 --> 04:52.530
Yeah, she's at my place.

04:52.560 --> 04:54.560
No wonder it was so quiet.

04:55.320 --> 04:56.110
So, where is she now?

04:56.420 --> 04:59.560
Well, she said she'd sleep for the whole day.

05:00.520 --> 05:03.420
Darn, I'm so jealous.

05:03.420 --> 05:06.140
Our summer vacation hasn't even started yet.

05:12.020 --> 05:13.180
This should be fine now.

05:17.120 --> 05:18.320
Good girl, good girl.

05:18.520 --> 05:21.120
Hey, I'll get embarrassed if you do that here.

05:21.120 --> 05:25.700
Don't worry, you did something good and I should praise you.

05:28.320 --> 05:29.410
All right, let's go.

05:30.480 --> 05:32.380
Wait for me.

06:32.140 --> 06:32.840
All right!

06:34.160 --> 06:35.650
Today's work is...

06:40.920 --> 06:43.240
It'd be great if everyone were willing to participate.

06:52.210 --> 06:53.510
Yo, you two.

06:53.590 --> 06:55.090
Good morning, Hatano-kun.

06:55.090 --> 06:56.460
Good morning, Nanami-chan.

06:56.490 --> 06:57.500
What's up, Kenji.

06:57.690 --> 06:59.090
Goodbye, Hatano-kun.

06:59.090 --> 07:01.430
What the heck? You're so cold this morning.

07:01.460 --> 07:04.230
I was planning on telling you some updated news.

07:07.490 --> 07:09.730
They're posting our final grades today, right?

07:09.990 --> 07:12.640
Yeah, even though I don't want to think about it.

07:13.090 --> 07:14.220
So what?

07:14.490 --> 07:18.620
Normally, we always have one week of living hell for students who failed the final.

07:18.790 --> 07:21.780
But this time, it's a little different.

07:21.990 --> 07:22.980
Different?

07:25.990 --> 07:27.400
Please.

07:27.890 --> 07:34.970
Participate in the volunteer activity today after school to clean up our town, please!

07:29.690 --> 07:30.440
That's it.

07:30.990 --> 07:32.110
Tae-senpai.

07:35.890 --> 07:39.420
It seems that if we participate in this volunteer activity, we can get out of school.

07:39.790 --> 07:42.900
Cleaning? That's really annoying.

07:43.190 --> 07:44.800
But you can get out of school.

07:45.890 --> 07:48.850
Ah, Tomosaka-kun, Konoe-san, good morning.

07:49.290 --> 07:51.080
Good morning.

07:51.790 --> 07:53.810
Have any volunteers signed up yet?

07:54.300 --> 07:55.730
None at all.

07:55.990 --> 07:59.800
In that case... I have a very energetic applicant for you.

08:00.890 --> 08:02.540
What do I have to apply?

08:02.690 --> 08:04.380
You can't pass anyway.

08:05.090 --> 08:10.720
You can steam this guy, bake this guy... or recycle him as trash.
Just do whatever you want with him.

08:10.790 --> 08:12.930
What did you say? You jerk!

08:14.590 --> 08:17.000
So, how about you?

08:17.490 --> 08:20.300
Aren't you at the edge of passing or failing?

08:25.490 --> 08:27.530
Heh, Hatano-kun.

08:27.880 --> 08:35.050
(Tl Note: "Scarlet Fang", the famous Japanese manga, "Scarlet Lightning," Sega's gaming control pad (gun-like), issued back in the 1980's, and "Scarlet Comet" Char Aznable, in the Gundam animation series.)

08:27.890 --> 08:35.050
Scarlet fang, scarlet lightning, scarlet comet, and a scarlet sports suit.

08:35.990 --> 08:42.160
From ancient times, anything that relates to this scarlet color... are all venerated by humans.

08:42.890 --> 08:47.090
In that case, anything that relates to this red color is not embarrassing at all.

08:47.390 --> 08:48.090
Oh, yeah...

08:48.390 --> 08:53.250
If you want to, we'll gain a great reputation under the name of the "Scarlet Triple Star" in history.

08:53.790 --> 08:55.580
(Tl Note: By "Red score," he meant a failing grade.)

08:53.790 --> 08:55.580
I'm pretty sure he's got a red score.

08:55.790 --> 08:57.220
Seems like it.

08:58.690 --> 09:01.980
Well, two people signed up.

09:13.090 --> 09:15.040
Even though we already knew the result would turn out like this...

09:15.290 --> 09:17.070
This is still a shock for me.

09:17.190 --> 09:20.440
Ken-chan, I'm going to volunteer too.

09:20.890 --> 09:22.900
You passed already.

09:23.310 --> 09:27.540
Yeah, but... I have nothing to do if I just go home.

09:27.790 --> 09:29.820
Nanami-chan is such a good girl,

09:29.890 --> 09:32.560
you are sharing the pain with your husband.

09:32.690 --> 09:36.020
No, it's not like that.

09:36.060 --> 09:39.630
Nanami, forget this guy. Let's go.

09:41.590 --> 09:44.730
I-I was joking. W-Wait.

09:44.910 --> 09:48.510
(City Cleaning Instruction Introduction Meeting)

09:46.090 --> 09:49.570
The reason for this cleaning before summer vacation starts...

09:49.690 --> 09:53.500
Is to make our town cleaner than it used to be.

09:53.590 --> 09:57.020
Everybody will feel good when their summer vacation starts.

09:58.590 --> 10:00.570
Sorry, we're late.

10:01.790 --> 10:04.320
Don't worry, we just started.

10:06.490 --> 10:08.300
Onii-chan, Nanami-oneechan.

10:09.690 --> 10:11.950
Ah? You failed, too?

10:11.990 --> 10:14.100
Don't judge other people like yourself.

10:14.190 --> 10:16.690
We're really volunteering for this, right?

10:17.980 --> 10:20.880
Me too, let's do our best.

10:20.910 --> 10:21.690
Yeah.

10:21.990 --> 10:24.920
Oh yeah, Dad wants me to tell you something.

10:24.990 --> 10:28.870
He said as a punishment for your failing grade, starting next month, your pocket money will be halved.

10:29.590 --> 10:32.470
Your dad's a teacher, that's so messed up.

10:33.390 --> 10:35.930
That darn old man.

10:38.820 --> 10:44.120
All right, all right. Now let's go through the instructions for this activity on the handout.

10:54.290 --> 10:58.540
Tomosaka-kun, you joined us just as I predicted.

10:59.090 --> 11:01.420
I think "predicted" won't be necessary.

11:04.390 --> 11:08.180
Well, as long as I can get out of school, I will do anything.

11:08.390 --> 11:10.580
Okay, do your best!

11:30.990 --> 11:32.720
I always wanted to do this.

11:34.390 --> 11:36.650
Tai-senpai, is this also part of the volunteer work?

11:37.690 --> 11:40.320
Well, actually this is the Student Council's work.

11:40.690 --> 11:42.420
Sorry, I asked you for your help.

11:43.190 --> 11:46.680
Does the Student Council always perform this kind of work?

11:46.690 --> 11:50.030
Only me, since I care about this stuff.

11:50.490 --> 11:53.300
All right, let's hurry up and get it done!

12:05.190 --> 12:06.100
Alrighty.

12:20.490 --> 12:23.630
Now it looks like our old school building can keep its function for a while longer.

12:23.890 --> 12:24.870
Yeah.

12:25.190 --> 12:27.140
It feels better now.

12:27.190 --> 12:30.850
That's true, but we are not finished yet, people.

12:30.890 --> 12:33.810
Now we have to start on our volunteer cleaning work in the town.

12:34.090 --> 12:35.920
Ahhhhhhh, yeah!

12:36.190 --> 12:37.780
I totally forgot that.

12:37.990 --> 12:39.720
Well, let's get going then.

12:56.790 --> 12:58.270
Feels so good!

12:58.890 --> 13:02.200
Weather like today would be best for swimming in the sea.

13:02.450 --> 13:05.060
I really want to jump into the sea right now, how about you?

13:08.290 --> 13:11.490
After the volunteering work, you can do whatever you want.

13:11.990 --> 13:13.440
But look at this...

13:20.220 --> 13:22.160
There's a lot of trash.

13:22.490 --> 13:23.820
Really...

13:24.000 --> 13:26.770
I didn't even realize it before.

13:27.110 --> 13:27.810
Here.

13:28.290 --> 13:31.130
It would be dangerous to injure your hands, so be careful, everybody.

13:31.590 --> 13:36.100
Once you've filled your bag, come to me and ask for a new one.

13:36.850 --> 13:39.790
After we finish the cleaning, we'll meet here again.

13:39.890 --> 13:40.960
All right, let's start.

13:43.690 --> 13:45.390
This is burnable trash, right?

13:45.390 --> 13:46.620
That's unburnable.

13:47.490 --> 13:49.300
Isn't that also unburnable?

13:49.490 --> 13:50.550
Really?

13:59.090 --> 14:00.060
W-What the heck?

14:01.190 --> 14:01.920
Senpai...

14:03.190 --> 14:04.500
Please give me another trash bag.

14:04.890 --> 14:07.460
You're amazing. You really did your best, Tomosaka-kun.

14:08.390 --> 14:08.830
Not really.

14:10.790 --> 14:13.380
Nanami, where did Hatano go?

14:13.390 --> 14:15.000
He was around here just now.

14:15.090 --> 14:18.420
Geez, that jerk... disappearing all of a sudden.

14:23.490 --> 14:24.720
What the heck is he doing there?

14:26.690 --> 14:29.290
So, how about this Sunday?

14:29.390 --> 14:31.130
I have two movie tickets.

14:31.690 --> 14:33.280
It would be fun, how about it?

14:33.890 --> 14:34.490
Let's go, okay?

14:34.490 --> 14:35.510
Hey, Hatano.

14:37.390 --> 14:39.230
What are you doing hooking up with girls?

14:39.290 --> 14:40.470
All right? Hikari-chan?

14:40.490 --> 14:41.040
What?

14:41.090 --> 14:41.690
Let's go, let's go.

14:41.690 --> 14:43.690
Geez, you've been so persistent.

14:43.690 --> 14:45.670
I said I'm not going.

14:45.790 --> 14:46.920
How could you...

14:47.490 --> 14:48.390
Hikari.

14:49.390 --> 14:52.420
Ah, you are here too? Is school over already?

14:52.690 --> 14:55.340
What are you doing here anyway?

14:55.590 --> 14:58.800
Should I really have to tell you what I can do on the beach during sunny days?

14:59.390 --> 15:01.490
Sun tanning, <i>sun tanning</i>!

15:02.690 --> 15:03.310
Here.

15:03.990 --> 15:05.070
What's this for?

15:05.290 --> 15:08.020
Just like what you've seen. This is a trash bag.

15:08.490 --> 15:12.940
I know that, but why do I have to pick up the trash for you?

15:13.190 --> 15:14.180
Gratitude.

15:15.290 --> 15:18.230
Show your gratitude to the sea.

15:18.590 --> 15:19.330
You got a problem with that?

15:20.690 --> 15:23.040
How could I possibly refuse if you put it like that?

15:23.990 --> 15:25.470
All right, Private Hatano.

15:25.590 --> 15:27.950
I now order you to assist Hikari in finishing up your mission.

15:28.090 --> 15:32.540
Roger, Captain, I will complete this mission even if I have to sacrifice my life!

15:32.890 --> 15:34.930
Okay, do your best.

15:35.590 --> 15:37.490
W-Wait.

15:38.190 --> 15:40.840
We have to absolutely follow Captain's order, Hikari-chan.

15:41.090 --> 15:43.280
What the heck are you talking about?

15:46.090 --> 15:48.010
H-Hikari-chan.

15:52.790 --> 15:54.410
Where are you looking?

15:54.590 --> 15:57.430
Let go, you pervert!

15:57.990 --> 16:01.670
I'm not releasing you!

16:58.690 --> 17:02.130
How can they throw trash in such a beautiful place?

17:02.790 --> 17:03.550
Tae-senpai.

17:05.290 --> 17:07.100
Tomosaka-kun, how is it going there?

17:07.390 --> 17:11.210
I've already finished, I thought you might be busy all by yourself.

17:11.490 --> 17:12.660
How about Konoe-san?

17:13.190 --> 17:15.000
She's helping Suzuka now.

17:15.590 --> 17:18.100
Thank you for your help.

17:28.290 --> 17:29.230
Tae-senpai.

17:29.430 --> 17:30.390
Huh?

17:31.290 --> 17:34.160
You saw us just now, right?

17:35.420 --> 17:39.300
Yeah... I think you're very well-behaved.

17:41.790 --> 17:42.730
Well-behaved?

17:42.990 --> 17:44.290
You're very well-behaved.

17:45.390 --> 17:51.010
Look, even when you were small... Didn't you take care of Konoe-san and the others?

17:51.990 --> 17:57.320
Yeah, Suzuka is my little sister, and Nanami grew up with me, so...

17:59.090 --> 18:02.480
I was just wondering how you can do that all the time.

18:04.590 --> 18:05.720
Doing that?

18:08.090 --> 18:11.690
Are you always doing this by yourself, Tae-senpai?

18:11.690 --> 18:15.630
Yeah, but this time there are many volunteers. You guys really saved me.

18:15.890 --> 18:16.610
Thanks.

18:16.790 --> 18:19.240
Not really, I did this because of my failing grade.

18:20.090 --> 18:20.800
Oh, yeah.

18:22.690 --> 18:23.140
Here.

18:24.790 --> 18:26.120
This is the grade I give to you.

18:26.890 --> 18:28.990
Don't tell the others, since I only have one.

18:29.990 --> 18:31.800
And today, you have been very well-behaved too, Tomosaka-kun.

18:32.090 --> 18:34.650
Tae-senpai is the real person who is very well-behaved.

18:35.390 --> 18:39.340
You've been doing all this work all the time without anybody praising you at all.

18:42.990 --> 18:43.730
Senpai?

18:45.100 --> 18:46.970
That's because I'm Onee-chan.

18:48.590 --> 18:49.330
Tae.

18:49.460 --> 18:50.310
Yes?

18:52.490 --> 18:56.360
Tae, you are very well-behaved, taking care of your little brothers and sisters all the time.

18:57.190 --> 18:58.830
I will reward you, come here.

19:04.490 --> 19:05.010
Here.

19:36.490 --> 19:37.500
Something like candy...

19:44.190 --> 19:45.360
Tomosaka-kun...

19:47.390 --> 19:48.490
You're very well-behaved, very well-behaved.

19:56.190 --> 19:58.160
No, nothing.

19:59.190 --> 20:03.140
Please, can you continue what you just did?

20:15.790 --> 20:16.680
Thank you.

20:30.290 --> 20:32.220
You all must be tired from today.

20:32.790 --> 20:37.430
But if we can make our living place cleaner, that's not bad, right?

20:37.490 --> 20:38.830
That's true.

20:39.190 --> 20:41.090
Yeah, it feels good.

20:42.990 --> 20:45.140
Well, I will go this way. See you tomorrow.

20:45.290 --> 20:46.500
Well, me too.

20:46.790 --> 20:48.540
See you later, Sakura-san.

20:50.490 --> 20:52.520
Goodbye, Tomosaka-senpai.

20:53.090 --> 20:57.700
Next time, I hope you will join us as a volunteer, and not just because you're failing, Tomosaka-kun.

20:58.290 --> 20:59.530
I'll think about it.

21:00.190 --> 21:01.080
See you.

21:01.590 --> 21:02.610
Take care.

21:03.890 --> 21:06.430
Oh, yeah, Hikari, where did Hatano go?

21:07.090 --> 21:09.630
Who knows, maybe he left earlier.

21:09.690 --> 21:12.560
That guy... sneaking away again...

21:27.590 --> 21:29.090
Captain!

21:29.390 --> 21:33.690
Mission failed!

21:37.240 --> 21:39.640
Tae-senpai is always wearing her sports uniform.

21:39.640 --> 21:41.740
That's because she's in the student council.

21:41.740 --> 21:45.140
Yeah, she mows the lawn and paints the buildings.

21:45.140 --> 21:47.440
She also picks up the trash, and cleans the storage.

21:47.440 --> 21:48.640
That's a lot of work.

21:48.640 --> 21:51.170
She cooks, cleans, and does the laundry.

21:51.730 --> 21:54.200
She takes care of here little sisters and brothers when they're asleep.

21:54.240 --> 21:55.970
She wears her sports uniform at home too.

21:56.640 --> 21:57.710
Next on Lamune:

21:58.040 --> 21:59.700
The Starry Sky and a Telescope.

21:59.940 --> 22:02.000
Ken-chan, say something to Senpai, okay?

22:00.810 --> 22:05.800
 Thanks to the following:
Ripper: TCT66; Original Timer: nanaya; Original Typesetter: kiasushou; Original Chinese Subs for Extra Scenes: Fino; English Subs: C1Anime

22:02.140 --> 22:05.800
I've never seen Senpai with her student uniform on.
